{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_546e170e555d7544","item_id":"slot_546e170e555d7544#1","text":"之前因为量起来之后，他们要靠整条线去给设备厂家配套，价格才能杀下来","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"retrospective","evidence_quote":"之前因为量起来之后，他们要靠整条线去给设备厂家配套，价格才能杀下来","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_3dbc6cda7b12f1d3","item_id":"slot_3dbc6cda7b12f1d3#1","text":"如果单一采购，单价其实挺高的","semantic_type":"condition","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"如果单一采购，单价其实挺高的","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_4804083574b77829","item_id":"slot_4804083574b77829#1","text":"跟先导的逻辑类似，他们是做整套设备的企业","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"跟先导的逻辑类似，他们是做整套设备的企业","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_27940dff086fb9fd","item_id":"slot_27940dff086fb9fd#1","text":"OK，这个您讲得很清楚，谢谢","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"OK，这个您讲得很清楚，谢谢","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_bd03be953bc661f1","item_id":"slot_bd03be953bc661f1#1","text":"在前段锂电铜箔这块，现在各类产品是相对标准化的，比如生箔机、阴极辊这些，还是定制化程度仍然很高？","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"我想请教一下，在前段锂电铜箔这块，现在各类产品是相对标准化的，比如生箔机、阴极辊这些，还是定制化程度仍然很高？","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_3ec738a30bf082a9","item_id":"slot_3ec738a30bf082a9#1","text":"您提问完了是吧？","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"专家：您提问完了是吧？","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_cd41537554c8c13e","item_id":"slot_cd41537554c8c13e#1","text":"对","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"answer","speech_role":"answer","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"主持人：对","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_0113b190bf8126e5","item_id":"slot_0113b190bf8126e5#1","text":"之前了解过锂电铜箔是小于9微米的，小于等于8微米的都属于锂电铜箔。但里面又分了极薄和标准的锂电铜箔","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"retrospective","evidence_quote":"之前了解过锂电铜箔是小于9微米的，小于等于8微米的都属于锂电铜箔。但里面又分了极薄和标准的锂电铜箔","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_90502a0e3ed545b8","item_id":"slot_90502a0e3ed545b8#1","text":"标准的是常规的6到8微米，或5到8微米","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"retrospective","evidence_quote":"标准的是常规的6到8微米，或5到8微米","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_de3417fcad2bcb55","item_id":"slot_de3417fcad2bcb55#1","text":"极薄的是小于等于4.5微米","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"retrospective","evidence_quote":"极薄的是小于等于4.5微米","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_d996e0617588c1f4","item_id":"slot_d996e0617588c1f4#1","text":"这两种铜箔对应的设备基本不一样——大体的结构一样","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"这两种铜箔对应的设备基本不一样——大体的结构一样","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_50a555a5eec4fda7","item_id":"slot_50a555a5eec4fda7#1","text":"但使用的配件不同","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"但使用的配件不同","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_978cbf6c94515aea","item_id":"slot_978cbf6c94515aea#1","text":"比如传感器、电机都不能一样","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"比如传感器、电机都不能一样","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_de6236d61c19169c","item_id":"slot_de6236d61c19169c#1","text":"薄的铜箔不能用重载电机，可能会拉断","semantic_type":"forecast","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"薄的铜箔不能用重载电机，可能会拉断","unknown_fields":[]}
